<title>USA: Warrantech unit, CompUSA extend contract.</title>
<headline>Warrantech unit, CompUSA extend contract.</headline>
<dateline>EULESS, Texas 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warrantech Corp Friday said its subsidiary, Warrantech Consumer Product Services Inc has entered into a 10-year contract with CompUSA Inc replacing a previously announced 4-year agreement.</p>
<p>Warrantech will continue to offer its marketing, administration and help-desk functions for extended service contracts sold through all CompUSA stores and PCS Compleat, Inc, a unit of CompUSA.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
